  "253695327": {
    "dominantColor": "#f5f5f2",
    "flushLayout": true,
    "modules": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_1.gif"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_2.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "textEn": "<br><br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Our Story</span></span><br><br>In Turkish culture, when someone knocks on the door, they are greeted with<br>a simple, warm, and welcoming question: \"<strong>Kim O?</strong>\"<br><br>In a noisy world, we choose to listen to the individual. We open our doors to every guest's voice, laughter, and unique presence.<br>It doesn't matter where you come from or how you identify yourself. The only thing that matters is that you're here.<br>Welcome to Cafe Kim O, a place designed to bring people together through genuine human connection.<br><br>",
        "textTr": "<br><br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Our Story</span></span><br><br>In Turkish culture, when someone knocks on the door, they are greeted with<br>a simple, warm, and welcoming question: \"<strong>Kim O?</strong>\"<br><br>In a noisy world, we choose to listen to the individual. We open our doors to every guest's voice, laughter, and unique presence.<br>It doesn't matter where you come from or how you identify yourself. The only thing that matters is that you're here.<br>Welcome to Cafe Kim O, a place designed to bring people together through genuine human connection.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_4.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "textEn": "<br><br>Now we turn to the hero of the story, Berk. We incorporated your signature hairstyle and the bold, oversized glasses<br>that have become your trademark directly into the logo. The door symbol, representing the bridge between people and<br>the connections they create, serves as another thoughtful element of the design.<br><br>For the typography, we chose a bold typeface with a compact, confident, and distinctive character. It reflects the<br>warmth, authenticity, and self-assurance that define the brand while standing apart from conventional café identities.<br><br>",
        "textTr": "<br><br>Now we turn to the hero of the story, Berk. We incorporated your signature hairstyle and the bold, oversized glasses<br>that have become your trademark directly into the logo. The door symbol, representing the bridge between people and<br>the connections they create, serves as another thoughtful element of the design.<br><br>For the typography, we chose a bold typeface with a compact, confident, and distinctive character. It reflects the<br>warmth, authenticity, and self-assurance that define the brand while standing apart from conventional café identities.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_6.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "textEn": "<br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Color Palette</span></span><br><br>Warm Cream: Chosen as the brand's primary background color, this tone creates a welcoming, organic, and inviting atmosphere.<br>It moves away from the coldness of pure white, instead expressing warmth, comfort, and the tactile quality of natural paper and cardboard.<br><br>Deep Green: A symbol of nature, freshness, and quality coffee and breakfast culture. It reinforces the brand's calm and relaxed<br>personality while adding a sense of depth, maturity, and premium character to the visual identity.<br><br>Warm Terracotta: An energetic and appetite stimulating tone that sparks curiosity. It represents the warmth of coffee,<br>the genuine connections that begin when a door opens, and the brand's bold, dynamic personality through a strong visual contrast.<br><br>",
        "textTr": "<br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Color Palette</span></span><br><br>Warm Cream: Chosen as the brand's primary background color, this tone creates a welcoming, organic, and inviting atmosphere.<br>It moves away from the coldness of pure white, instead expressing warmth, comfort, and the tactile quality of natural paper and cardboard.<br><br>Deep Green: A symbol of nature, freshness, and quality coffee and breakfast culture. It reinforces the brand's calm and relaxed<br>personality while adding a sense of depth, maturity, and premium character to the visual identity.<br><br>Warm Terracotta: An energetic and appetite stimulating tone that sparks curiosity. It represents the warmth of coffee,<br>the genuine connections that begin when a door opens, and the brand's bold, dynamic personality through a strong visual contrast.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_8.gif"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_9.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_10.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_11.gif"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_12.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_13.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_14.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_15.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_16.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_17.gif"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_18.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "textEn": "<br><br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Our Story</span></span><br><br>In Turkish culture, when someone knocks on the door, they are greeted with<br>a simple, warm, and welcoming question: \"<strong>Kim O?</strong>\"<br><br>In a noisy world, we choose to listen to the individual. We open our doors to every guest's voice, laughter, and unique presence.<br>It doesn't matter where you come from or how you identify yourself. The only thing that matters is that you're here.<br>Welcome to Cafe Kim O, a place designed to bring people together through genuine human connection.<br><br>",
        "textTr": "<br><br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Our Story</span></span><br><br>In Turkish culture, when someone knocks on the door, they are greeted with<br>a simple, warm, and welcoming question: \"<strong>Kim O?</strong>\"<br><br>In a noisy world, we choose to listen to the individual. We open our doors to every guest's voice, laughter, and unique presence.<br>It doesn't matter where you come from or how you identify yourself. The only thing that matters is that you're here.<br>Welcome to Cafe Kim O, a place designed to bring people together through genuine human connection.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_20.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "textEn": "<br><br>For this logo, we focused on the iconic forms at the heart of café culture, reducing them to their most minimal<br>geometric expressions and integrating them into the graphic language of our custom typography.<br><br>At the core of our design system is the eye symbol. It represents seeing every guest, caring for them, and celebrating<br>the genuine connections we create together, regardless of who they are or where they come from.<br><br>",
        "textTr": "<br><br>For this logo, we focused on the iconic forms at the heart of café culture, reducing them to their most minimal<br>geometric expressions and integrating them into the graphic language of our custom typography.<br><br>At the core of our design system is the eye symbol. It represents seeing every guest, caring for them, and celebrating<br>the genuine connections we create together, regardless of who they are or where they come from.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/projects/253695327/image_22.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "textEn": "<br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Color Palette</span></span><br><br>Sand Beige (Left Color): A natural, earthy tone with a calming presence. As the primary background color,<br>it brings warmth and depth to the identity while softly balancing the contrast between the other two colors.<br><br>Olive Green (Center Color): Inspired by Mediterranean culture, it symbolizes freshness, olive oil, and organic living.<br>It gives the brand a subtle retro feel while conveying a calm, natural character.<br><br>Burgundy / Plum (Right Color): A rich, warm, and sophisticated tone that evokes ripe fruits, wine, and comforting<br>hot beverages. It adds a sense of refinement, premium quality, and a strong visual focal point to the identity.<br><br>",
        "textTr": "<br><br><span class=\"text-header\"><span class=\"header-inner\">Color Palette</span></span><br><br>Sand Beige (Left Color): A natural, earthy tone with a calming presence. As the primary background color,<br>it brings warmth and depth to the identity while softly balancing the contrast between the other two colors.<br><br>Olive Green (Center Color): Inspired by Mediterranean culture, it symbolizes freshness, olive oil, and organic living.<br>It gives the brand a subtle retro feel while conveying a calm, natural character.<br><br>Burgundy / Plum (Right Color): A rich, warm, and sophisticated tone that evokes ripe fruits, wine, and comforting<br>hot beverages. It adds a sense of refinement, premium quality, and a strong visual focal point to the identity.<br><br>"
      },
